flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Launch Tkinter application]
    B --> C{Choose memory model}
    C -->|Paging| D[Enter process ID and size]
    C -->|Segmentation| E[Enter process ID and size]
    D --> F[Calculate required pages]
    F --> G{Enough free frames?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Assign free frames and update page table]
    G -->|No| I[Show allocation failure]
    E --> J[Find first contiguous free hole]
    J --> K{Hole large enough?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Allocate segment and update memory map]
    K -->|No| M[Show allocation failure]
    H --> N[Refresh dashboard and event log]
    I --> N
    L --> N
    M --> N
    N --> O{Deallocate, auto-demo, reset, or continue?}
    O -->|Deallocate| P[Release frames or segment]
    P --> N
    O -->|Continue| C
    O -->|Reset| Q[Clear simulation state]
    Q --> N
    O -->|Exit| R([End])
